OL,4,CITV investigating soap actor after bar 
OL,5,Cincident                               
OL,6,GITV is investigating a Coronation      
OL,7,GStreet actor following an alleged bar  
OL,8,Galtercation.                           
OL,10,FJacob Roberts is known for playing Det 
OL,11,FCon Kit Green on the ITV soap since    
OL,12,F2024. According to reports by the Sun  
OL,13,Fnewspaper, video footage appears to    
OL,14,Fshow him shouting outside Kiely's      
OL,15,FIrish Bar in Manchester on 8 November. 
OL,17,FGreater Manchester Police said         
OL,18,Fofficers had attended a bar in Watson  
OL,19,FStreet at about 02:30 GMT following    
OL,20,Freports of a disturbance. No arrests   
OL,21,Fhave been made.                        
